{"id": "69271", "title": "一米爱", "author": "玉笙凉", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 32, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69271.htm", "intro": "衷心感谢小刈刈童鞋为本文制作的封面！\r\n 文艺版：\r\n 如果爱，请深爱；如放弃，请彻底。\r\n 可是爱如果只有一米，\r\n 深不得弃不得，\r\n 该如何是好？\r\n \r\n 剧情版：\r\n   人家说，年轻时总要谈一场伤筋动骨的恋爱，人生才完美。\r\n 好吧，前男友也变成了准妹夫，她的人生完美了。\r\n 人家说，结婚就是两个人凑凑合合过日子，这才是生活。\r\n 好吧，听从父母之命媒妁之言，她尊重了生活。\r\n 可是，为毛她还是华丽丽地炮灰了？\r\n 到底啥叫完美啥叫生活？\r\n 她悲愤了······\r\n 如果大家喜欢这个故事，请戳：  收藏此文章。\r\n 我的专栏，求包养：", "base": "files/article/html/69/69271", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "10594940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10594941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10594942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10594943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10594944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10594945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10594946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10594947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10594948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10594949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10594950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10594951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "10594952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "10594953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "10594954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "10594955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "10594956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "10594957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "10594958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20-23", "file": "10594959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-27", "file": "10594960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-31", "file": "10594961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-35", "file": "10594962.html", "availab